{"DB migration creates embeddable_hosts table and deletes site_settings keys - a one-way structural change that could cause new embedding endpoints to lack data and fail if migration fails or is skipped": 0.09561005979776382, "High-churn embedding feature spans frontend adapter, backend controller, and routes across wide surface area, increasing risk of merge conflicts, permission gaps, and regressions": 0.024871500208973885, "Admin embedding management update action is a no-op - the PUT /admin/customize/embedding endpoint does not apply any changes despite UI triggering update when saving": 0.4270312488079071, "Embed controller ensure_embeddable uses rescue after end of method with unusual Ruby syntax that may be interpreted differently by Ruby versions or lead to syntax/runtime errors": 0.13956400752067566, "EmbeddableHost model tightly couples embedding import and host validation - if no matching EmbeddableHost record exists for a URL, imported posts may receive nil category or fail silently": 0.18801002204418182, "Topic expandable_first_post? gating removed embeddable_hosts check, potentially enabling embeds more broadly even when no hosts are configured": 0.11887354403734207, "Embedding UI component and template changes introduced in parallel with REST adapter and serializer changes increases risk of binding mismatches and UI regressions": 0.002257781568914652, "Rest adapter admin model lookup uses brittle type normalization (underscore to dash) that could fail if Ember Data uses different type naming, breaking admin embedding operations": 0.05268378555774689, "Hydration of embedded associations changed to handle *_ids with pluralized key, changing in-memory representation that may break callers expecting original key shape": 0.07569408416748047, "Site settings config removal of embeddable_hosts and embed_category risks new deployments having neither site_settings defaults nor database records if migration is skipped or fails": 0.02720010094344616, "X-Frame-Options set to ALLOWALL on embedding endpoint disables clickjacking protection and could allow embedding the admin/embedding UI in third-party sites via iframe": 0.10987158864736557, "Topic retrieval flow now relies on EmbeddableHost.host_allowed? instead of SiteSetting-based checks - need to verify all call sites and tests cover new validation path": 0.019243957474827766, "Admin embedding and embeddable-hosts controller REST actions lack test coverage beyond subclass assertions, leaving authorization failures, param edge cases, and serialization behavior unverified": 0.21090278029441833, "Federated embedding tests adapted to use EmbeddableHost but may have gaps in coverage for invalid referer, missing referer, and multiple hosts scenarios": 0.02743370644748211, "Fabricator duplication in tests - category fabricator logic duplicated across spec/fabricators/category_fabricator.rb and spec/fabricators/embeddable_host_fabricator.rb causing potential conflicts": 0.5848923325538635, "EmbeddableHost model validations and belongs_to :category association edge cases not fully covered in tests, including invalid host formats and nil category behavior": 0.27316048741340637, "TopicEmbed.import test confirms embeddable_host's category is used for new post via eh.try(:category_id) pattern": 0.4512367844581604}